Whether you're just starting out or looking to unlock full earning potential, upgrading your Beat22 account is easy and flexible. Here's a breakdown of your upgrade options based on your current plan.

## **If you're on the basic plan:**

You can upgrade anytime by going to the **Subscriptions** section in your dashboard or by clicking on this link: [Subscriptions | beat22](https://beat22.com/subscriptions)

![](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-234219.png)

-   You can choose from:

1.  **Premium Annual – ₹3,999/year**
2.  **Pro Monthly – ₹599/month**
3.  **Pro Annual – ₹5,999/year** *(Best value!)*

![](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-234303.png)

-   Then click on “Continue to payment”

![](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-234345.png)

-   Fill in your contact details, email ID and proceed with the payment via Amazon Pay, PhonePe, GooglePay, UPI, Credit Card, Debit card:

![](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-234401.png)

-   Click the checkbox to agree to the “I agree to Terms of Service and Privacy Policy”.
-   Click "Pay & Subscribe" to finalize the upgrade.

**Why go Pro Annual?**

-   Top placement in searches & playlists
-   Unlock negotiation for exclusive beats
-   Maximum earning potential

## **If You’re on the Premium Annual Plan:**

You have 3 options:

1.  ### **Let it complete**
    

-   If you’ve canceled auto-renew (mandate), your plan will end after one year.
-   You won’t be charged again unless you manually renew.

*Please email us at support@beat22.com to cancel the mandate.*

2.  ### **Upgrade to pro monthly (Midway)**
    

-   Pay ₹599 separately for that month.
-   Your Premium plan will continue in parallel.

*Please email us at **support@beat22.com** to upgrade your plan to Pro monthly.*

3.  ### **Upgrade to pro annual (Midway)**
    

You have **two choices**:

-   **Switch and Adjust**: Pay an adjusted amount for the remaining months based on your usage so far. Send us an email to supportbeat22.com for upgradation.
-   **Start Fresh**: Cancel Premium and begin a **new Pro Annual plan** by paying ₹5,999.

*Please email us at support@beat22.com to upgrade your plan to Pro Annual.* **We recommend starting fresh with Pro Annual** for uninterrupted benefits for a full year.

## **If you’re on the pro monthly plan:**

Want to upgrade to **Pro Annual**?

-   You can do so anytime by paying ₹5,999.
-   Your current monthly payment won’t be refunded.
-   A new Pro Annual cycle will begin immediately.

Best for serious producers who want consistency, full features, and no monthly hassle.
